{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026iEJS7SwCGF1792749474.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>高海寧日前遠赴非洲肯亞展開夢幻之旅，成功解鎖人生願望清單（Bucket list）。她在社交平台上載多張旅遊精彩花絮照，興奮地留言透露自己正繼續完成願望清單去非洲看動物，並感歎這次是「The BEST trip ever（最棒的旅程）」，興奮心情溢於言表。</p><p></p><p>相片中所見，高海寧乘搭小型客機前往目的地，換上一身休閒防風裝束並戴上鴨舌帽，正式展開野外探險之旅。她更化身為專業攝影師，手持配備長焦「大炮」鏡頭的專業相機，坐在越野車上親自捕捉野生動物的各種英姿。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"514d4299-8672-46c2-9db7-5db33238ccee.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026dBD5uWShO01792749474.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"93a3017e-7f68-43d5-a8f9-b17021c06429.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026mZX41locOm1792749474.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>在探險期間，高海寧不僅成功與近在咫尺的巨型大象同框合照，更俏皮地伸手指著遠處草叢中的獅子自拍，展現出無比雀躍的心情。除了追蹤野生動物之外，她亦體驗了當地的風土人情，與肯亞居民親切合照，大家一同揮手甜笑，互動相當融洽。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:42:57.579646+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T22:18:10.703627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:38:28.023124+00:00","content_hash":"6c493a3dcd6fa61cbae232abe995c4c1b8e56a7a5f40b755b14d2cb93ec3d001","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}